{"lines":[{"h":0.020198147022092772,"w":0.2316246795654297,"t":"Sample Writing answers","c":1,"y":0.040650086119531359,"x":0.081294278656376562},{"w":0.77681289672851572,"h":0.018554104005807703,"c":1,"y":0.089261050577640777,"x":0.12809715011568207,"t":"Vocabulary is used with a natural and sophisticated control [bound to | trapped in a"},{"x":0.13000557176210312,"w":0.77299118041992188,"c":1,"y":0.10728858255994678,"t":"cycle of poverty | severe traffic congestion | knock-on effects], although rare errors","h":0.021118166439258457},{"w":0.75339808146158838,"c":1,"t":"remain [education opportunities \/ educational opportunities]. Grammar is tlexible","h":0.017575889658705157,"x":0.12815532812482738,"y":0.12790697663082595},{"y":0.14275088639025446,"w":0.74401850382486967,"h":0.023929916809652507,"c":1,"t":"and accurate, with a wide range of structures included. There are some shorter","x":0.12992160239456826},{"t":"sentences which could be extended and more multi-clause examples could be","h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1,"w":0.7339805603027344,"x":0.13009709845884496,"y":0.1656976745116322},{"w":0.2601941680908203,"t":"included to add complexity.","h":0.016199376947040434,"y":0.18598130832190951,"c":1,"x":0.12621359546371602},{"h":0.019806672330957342,"c":1,"w":0.716621805826823,"x":0.130039247412361,"t":"To improve this response, consideration should be given to the impact of the","y":0.22061847880271901},{"x":0.12815534354517599,"y":0.24127906965126855,"c":1,"t":"shrinking population in the countryside.","w":0.37281552632649739,"h":0.01744186068621012},{"y":0.959302325462148,"x":0.083495146238441509,"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"134","h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3209}